          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuká' an tlahh'aá mibaá nee tsár awa múk Israeli, nee gaarí an /aymi'iidá' baabuúín aa káh qoomár ngiwa tsuúq. Umuú heewo ar adoodá' inós wa hariim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israeli na/iiwós gina hara'ayín, giri báy, «Aníng gwa'araaro aga nakaá/. Bara gwaá' án ir folá' dinkwa nee taati'iieé' baraá mar'idár baraá qaymór Efroni, oo múk Hiti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amooqár Makpela, Mamrero da/aáw, baraá yaamaá Kana'ani. Abrahamu mar'irí nee qaymoodá' gana tlaáxw dír Efroni wa alé, múk Hiti, tawa dír ta múk í foliiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoodá' an dír Abrahamu nee hareerós Sara ki foliít, nee an dír Isaka nee hareeró Rebeka ki foliít, nee an dír Lea ngi foól sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaymo nee mar'iro, tidá' amoodá' i dirii', kana tlaáxw dír múk Hiti wa alé.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo alqaduuwós ngiwa hhe'eés ooaro dír daaqaywose, ya'aawós giri gawaá qatnírí tsa/aás, hiinsluú alhhe'eesáy guri uuruúx, iri tsatiít.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.33"
            ]
          }
        }
